Q3. Create a Postman environment for a Flipkart-style product API with a variable baseUrl, and use this variable in your requests to fetch product details.

Steps:

1. Click Environments in Postman.
2. Click Create New Environment.
3. Environment Name: FlipkartAPI

4. Add Variable:

Variable Name : baseUrl
Initial Value : http://localhost/api
Current Value : http://localhost/api

5. Save the environment.

6. Use the variable in requests:

GET {{baseUrl}}/products

7. Select the environment and click Send.
8. Verify product details are returned successfully.